                    <focus-ctd-template text="The collateral is recorded, and the system calculates the LTV ratio as 95%, displaying a deviation warning."/>
                    <focus-ctd-template text="The loan application is submitted for review, and the status is updated to &quot;Under Review&quot;."/>
                    <focus-ctd-template text="The system displays a deviation flag due to the high LTV ratio, requiring approval from a senior credit officer."/>
                    <focus-ctd-template text="The loan application is approved, and the status is updated to &quot;Approved&quot;."/>
                    <focus-ctd-template text="The system performs apportionment for the collateral, updating the database with the apportionment details."/>
                    <focus-ctd-template text="The legal documents are generated with the correct details, including the loan amount, collateral details, and apportionment information."/>
